1
00:00:04,462 --> 00:00:08,012
(Leonard:)Look at us, getting ready
for a double date with actual women...

2
00:00:08,174 --> 00:00:11,514
(Leonard:)...who publicly acknowledge
they're our girlfriends.

3
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:15,178
Yes. I mean,
actual women are the best.

4
00:00:15,348 --> 00:00:18,768
(Sheldon:)I don't understand.
What other kind of women are there?

5
00:00:18,935 --> 00:00:22,605
(Leonard:)Artificial women are your department.
You wanna take this?

6
00:00:24,232 --> 00:00:26,692
(Howard:)No, it would just freak him out.

7
00:00:28,111 --> 00:00:30,531
(Howard:)Listen, before we leave,
I should warn you...

8
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:32,197
(Howard:)...I'm a passionate man...

9
00:00:32,365 --> 00:00:35,745
(Howard:)...and I tend towards
public displays of affection.

10
00:00:36,661 --> 00:00:39,251
(Leonard:)What are you trying to tell me, Howard?

11
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:42,329
There might be making out
in the car or restaurant.

12
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,790
(Howard:)I don't want Bernadette
to feel uncomfortable...

13
00:00:44,961 --> 00:00:48,091
(Howard:)...so it would help
if you and Penny made out too.

14
00:00:49,215 --> 00:00:52,965
(Leonard:)Don't worry, we're planning to have sex
right on the salad bar.

15
00:00:54,596 --> 00:00:56,476
(Raj(arriving):)Namaste, white people.

16
00:00:57,849 --> 00:00:59,559
Good news. I've rented us...

17
00:00:59,726 --> 00:01:02,226
(Raj(arriving):)-...the four-hour edition of Watchmen.
-Got it.

18
00:01:02,395 --> 00:01:05,645
(Howard:)-Seen it.
-Detailed analysis posted online.

19
00:01:06,357 --> 00:01:08,027
Then what are we gonna do tonight?

20
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:11,113
Sorry. Howard and I are going out
with Penny and Bernadette.

21
00:01:11,279 --> 00:01:14,319
(Howard:)Yeah, no more carefree bachelor nights
for me and Leonard.

22
00:01:14,491 --> 00:01:17,081
(Howard:)These broncos have been saddled.

23
00:01:17,243 --> 00:01:19,913
[IMITATES HORSE WHINNYING]

24
00:01:22,248 --> 00:01:23,958
(Leonard:)How did we get actual women?

25
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:27,840
(Raj:)Great. They get girlfriends
and they just abandon us?

26
00:01:28,004 --> 00:01:29,794
(Sheldon:)It is great, isn't it?

27
00:01:30,632 --> 00:01:32,512
(Sheldon:)We have a wonderful evening
ahead of us.

28
00:01:32,675 --> 00:01:34,005
(Raj:)-We do?
-Oh, yes.

29
00:01:34,177 --> 00:01:37,887
I discovered I don't have enough room
on my hard drive for a LINUX partition.

30
00:01:38,056 --> 00:01:40,846
You and I are gonna perform
a full backup, reinitialize...

31
00:01:41,017 --> 00:01:43,397
(Sheldon:)...and then reinstall
all my operating systems.

32
00:01:44,187 --> 00:01:46,897
-I don't wanna do that.
-All right.

33
00:01:47,065 --> 00:01:49,775
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm going to perform
a full backup, reinitialize...

34
00:01:49,943 --> 00:01:52,693
(Sheldon:)...and then reinstall
all my operating systems.

35
00:01:52,862 --> 00:01:54,612
Well, what about me?

36
00:01:54,781 --> 00:01:58,741
(Sheldon:)Well, I understand there are
several types of artificial women.

37
00:02:00,662 --> 00:02:04,042
(Sheldon:)Maybe you should look into that.

